OL,5,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition starts at Chimneys
OL,7,     FB&B in Suffolk, where Carolyn
OL,8,     Fhopes that her guests will like
OL,9,     Fher uptempo personality. But
OL,10,     FAndrea and John aren't keen on
OL,11,     Fbeing in self-catering.
OL,12,G1035 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FNeale and Julie welcome their
OL,14,     Frivals to their vegetarian B&B,
OL,15,     FCopperfields Guest House in
OL,16,     FBroadstairs, Kent. But parking
OL,17,     Fcauses concern for guests Andrea
OL,18,     Fand John.
