OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe B&B battle begins at Fountain
OL,7,     FCottage in Northumberland. The
OL,8,     FB&Bers have a barrel of laughs on
OL,9,     Fa trip to a brewery. But pro chef
OL,10,     FMichael's breakfast leaves one
OL,11,     Fguest with a bellyache.
